# Fleabag Workshop · social meme cards (design system)

When generating **phrase meme cards** or **carousel covers** for Fleabag / workshop social posts, keep this visual system unless the user explicitly asks for a different style.

## Canvas & format

- **Phrase cards:** `1:1` (1080×1080) — Instagram / Telegram feed default.
- **First card in a set** may be `4:3` if legacy; new cards prefer **1:1**.
- **Carousel cover:** `1:1`, scroll-stopping hook text + same palette.

## Look & feel

| Element | Rule |
|--------|------|
| Background | Dark warm **pub-night bokeh** (amber/teal glow, not flat black) |
| Typography | Bold **Impact-style** white headline; gold `#fde68a` / `#fbbf24` for kicker/subline |
| Illustration | **Polished cartoonish** — witty scene, cinematic, not corporate stock |
| Bottom bar | Clean sans-serif caption: gloss in EN (+ RU in post text, not always on image) |
| Mood | Dry British humor, Fleabag energy, English-learning meme — **not** childish clipart |

## Phrase card layout

1. **Top:** target phrase (big meme headline).
2. **Center:** humorous illustration tied to phrase + social-media angle when requested.
3. **Bottom bar:** short gloss (`phrase = meaning`).
4. Optional speech bubble with example line from the show.

## Cover / viral hook patterns

- **ESC promo:** top line `ENGLISH SPEAKING CLUB · EVERY SUNDAY 1 PM MOSCOW TIME`.
- **FOMO hook:** we already say these out loud → join us.
- **Before → after:** spoke live → now see in memes.
- **CTA:** tap 🃏 on cool words / swipe the carousel.
- **Series tag:** `Fleabag S2E1` or `Workshop · cool phrases`.

## In-app integration

- Images live in `workshops/fleabag/memes/` (`01-…png` ordered).
- Map phrases → images in `workshops/fleabag/js/fleabag-phrase-memes.js`.
- Lesson tape: 🃏 opens `openPhraseMeme()` in `fleabag-lesson.js`.

## Anatomy check (AI images)

- **Exactly two arms** on human characters; no extra limbs.
- Text must be **readable** and spelled correctly on card.

## Do not

- Bright corporate gradients, emoji spam on image, tiny unreadable type.
- Change palette to purple/pink unrelated to Fleabag workshop skin.
- Put Russian body text on the image unless user asks (gloss stays in caption/post).
